  *   - optional MT7531 switch on GMAC0 (SGMII0)
  *   - optional directly attached PHYs on GMAC0/GMAC1: Realtek
- *     RTL8221B(-VB-CG) 2.5G, Motorcomm YT8821 2.5G or the MT7981 built-in
- *     GbE PHY
+ *     RTL8221B(-VB-CG) 2.5G, Motorcomm YT8821 2.5G, MaxLinear GPY211C 2.5G
+ *     or the MT7981 built-in GbE PHY
+ *   - optional 2.5G PHY on MT7531 port 5 (SGMII), e.g. MT7986 boards
  *
